<title>UK: Argentina sets 500 billion lire 7-year bond.</title>
<headline>Argentina sets 500 billion lire 7-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ARGENTINA</p>
<p> AMT    500 BLN LIRE  COUPON     11.0 PCT  MATURITY    05.NOV.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.608   PAY DATE    05.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.483    SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	B1	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB-	 DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMS US/UK/IT/AR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  ARGENTINA TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.125     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>		SENIOR, UNSECURED.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
